# Upstream Model Licenses & Legal Directory

This document details the licensing terms, upstream repositories, copyright holders, and usage conditions for all 14 third-party model source trees vendored in `backend/thirdparty/`.

---

## Model Licensing Summary Table

| Subdirectory | Model Name | Primary Task | Upstream Authors | Upstream Repository | License Type | Commercial Usable? |
|---|---|---|---|---|:---:|:---:|
| `FastMesh/` | FastMesh V1K / V4K | Quad Retopology | FastMesh Contributors | [FastMesh](https://github.com/Silentzx2/ForMesh3D-ThirdParty/tree/main/FastMesh) | **MIT** | Yes |
| `Hi3D/` | Hi3D v1.0 | Geometry Refinement | Hi3D Team | [hi3d-official/Hi3Dv1.0](https://github.com/hi3d-official/Hi3Dv1.0) | **Apache 2.0** | Yes |
| `Hunyuan3D-2.1/` | Hunyuan3D-2.1 | Shape & PBR Texture | Tencent Hunyuan | [Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2.1](https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2.1) | **Tencent Community** | Conditional (MAU limits) |
| `hunyuan3d-2/` | Hunyuan3D DiT Mini | Fast Shape Gen | Tencent Hunyuan | [Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2](https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2) | **Tencent Community** | Conditional (MAU limits) |
| `Paint3D/` | Paint3D | PBR Mesh Texture | OpenTexture Team | [OpenTexture/Paint3D](https://github.com/OpenTexture/Paint3D) | **Apache 2.0** | Yes |
| `PartUV/` | PartUV | Conformal UV Unwrapping | Eric Wang et al. | [EricWang12/PartUV](https://github.com/EricWang12/PartUV) | **Apache 2.0** | Yes |
| `Pixal3D/` | Pixal3D | Camera-Aware Shape | Tencent ARC | [TencentARC/Pixal3D](https://github.com/TencentARC/Pixal3D) | **CC BY-NC-SA 4.0** | **NO (Research Only)** |
| `Taobao3D/` | TaoFlowForge | Flow-Matching Mesh | Alibaba Taobao 3D | [alibaba/Taobao3D](https://github.com/alibaba/Taobao3D) | **Apache 2.0** | Yes |
| `TRELLIS/` | TRELLIS | Structured FlexiCubes | Microsoft Research | [microsoft/TRELLIS](https://github.com/microsoft/TRELLIS) | **MIT** | Yes |
| `TRELLIS.2/` | TRELLIS.2 | Cascaded FlexiDualGrid | Microsoft Research | [microsoft/TRELLIS.2](https://github.com/microsoft/TRELLIS.2) | **MIT** | Yes |
