| `TripoSG/` | TripoSG | Large Reconstruction | VAST AI Research | [VAST-AI-Research/TripoSG](https://github.com/VAST-AI-Research/TripoSG) | **Apache 2.0** | Yes |
| `Unique3D/` | Unique3D | Multi-View Mesh Gen | Tsinghua & AiuniAI | [AiuniAI/Unique3D](https://github.com/AiuniAI/Unique3D) | **Apache 2.0** | Yes |
| `ardy/` | ARDY | Text-to-Motion AI | NVIDIA Research | [nv-tlabs/ardy](https://github.com/nv-tlabs/ardy) | **NVIDIA Non-Commercial** | **NO (Research Only)** |

